  "写清楚谁或什么、在哪里、做什么、镜头怎么动；可按 @ 引用图片。": "Describe who or what, where it is, what happens, and how the camera moves. You can use @ to reference images.",
  "描述视频内容，支持运镜指令。例如：[推进]一只猫咪在花园中奔跑，镜头缓缓推进特写": "Describe the video content and camera movement. Example: [Push in] A cat runs through a garden as the camera slowly pushes in for a close-up.",
  "不传图片时生成文生视频；传一张图片时描述画面如何运动；传首尾两帧时描述过渡过程。": "With no image, describe a text-to-video scene. With one image, describe how it moves. With first and last frames, describe the transition.",
  "结合参考图片、视频或音频，描述主体、动作、声音和镜头关系。": "Use the reference images, videos, or audio to describe the subject, action, sound, and camera relationship.",
