  "分辨率越高细节越清晰、边缘更稳定。\n同时显存占用与生成耗时会明显增加。": "Higher resolution gives clearer details and steadier edges.\nIt also uses more VRAM and takes longer.",
  "帧率越高运动更顺滑、动作更连贯。\n但生成更慢、成本更高。\n常用 24 帧；想更快或更省可选 16 帧。": "Higher frame rate makes motion smoother and more continuous.\nGeneration is slower and costs more.\n24 fps is common; choose 16 fps for faster or cheaper runs.",
  "官方范围 1-60 fps；24 fps 较稳妥，30 fps 更顺滑。提高帧率会在相同时长下生成更多帧，成本和耗时会增加。": "Official range is 1-60 fps. 24 fps is reliable, while 30 fps is smoother. Higher frame rates generate more frames for the same duration, increasing cost and processing time.",
  "帧数决定生成片段的长度：数值越大视频越长、耗时越高。\n填 0 表示按源视频全长处理（适合整段替换）。": "Frame count controls clip length: higher values make longer videos and take more time.\nUse 0 to process the full source video, which is useful for full-segment replacement.",
  "秒数决定生成视频的时长：数值越大视频越长、耗时与成本越高。": "Seconds control the video duration: higher values make longer videos and increase time and cost.",
  "1080p 图生视频，适合首帧单图驱动": "1080p image-to-video, ideal for single first-frame input",
  "1600 及以上分辨率需要使用 48G 显存执行。": "Resolutions of 1600 or above require 48 GB VRAM.",
  "16帧": "16 fps",
  "24帧": "24 fps",
  "30帧": "30 fps",
  "4k,高清画质": "4K, high-definition quality",
  "阿里旗舰模型，支持长上下文与文本推理": "Alibaba flagship model with long-context and text reasoning support",
  "阿里最强开源模型Qwen2.5": "Alibaba's strongest open-source Qwen2.5 model",
  被替换图: "Image to replace",
  "标准 / Fast；使用示例：[推进]一只猫咪在花园中奔跑，镜头缓缓推进特写": "Standard/Fast. Example: [Push in] A cat runs through a garden as the camera slowly pushes in for a close-up",
