  "不接素材时描述文生视频；接首帧/尾帧时可用 @图片1 / @图片2 指代。例如：让 @图片1 中的人物向镜头挥手，随后过渡到 @图片2 的街景。": "Describe text-to-video when no assets are connected. With first/last frames, refer to them as @Image1 / @Image2. Example: have the person in @Image1 wave at the camera, then transition to the street scene in @Image2.",
  "不接素材时描述文生视频；接首帧/尾帧时描述 @图片1 到 @图片2 的变化。例如：@图片1 中的猫咪缓缓向前走，最后过渡到 @图片2 的画面，电影质感。": "Describe text-to-video when no assets are connected. With first/last frames, describe the change from @Image1 to @Image2. Example: the cat in @Image1 slowly walks forward and transitions into the scene in @Image2, cinematic.",
  "不接素材时描述文生视频；接首帧/尾帧时描述动作、运镜和过渡。例如：人物缓缓站起身，向镜头走来；或镜头从海边缓慢移向山顶。": "Describe text-to-video when no assets are connected. With first/last frames, describe the action, camera movement, and transition. Example: the person slowly stands and walks toward the camera, or the camera moves from the beach to the mountaintop.",
  "不接素材时描述文生视频；接首帧或首尾帧时描述动作、运镜和过渡。4K 图生当前只使用首帧。": "Describe text-to-video when no assets are connected. With a first frame or first/last frames, describe the action, camera movement, and transition. 4K image-to-video currently uses only the first frame.",
  "不接图时描述文生视频；接 @图片1 是首帧，接 @图片1 + @图片2 是首尾帧。例如：@图片1 中的人物缓缓转身微笑，最后过渡到 @图片2 的构图。": "Describe text-to-video when no image is connected. @Image1 is the first frame; @Image1 + @Image2 are first/last frames. Example: the person in @Image1 slowly turns and smiles, finally transitioning to the composition in @Image2.",
  不选: "None",
