  "开启：把遮罩按矩形区域处理，适合规则边界、字幕区、框内替换。关闭：按真实轮廓遮罩，更适合人物和复杂边缘。": "On: process the mask as a rectangle, useful for regular borders, subtitle areas, or replacement inside a box. Off: use the actual mask contour, better for people and complex edges.",
  "开启：更贴合原场景的光影、色调和边缘过渡，整体更自然。关闭：更偏直接替换，人物特征更突出。": "On: better matches the original lighting, color, and edge transitions for a more natural result. Off: more direct replacement with stronger character features.",
  "开启：系统会自动识别并扣除主体，适合替换有明显主体的视频、单人替换等。关闭：不做主体扣除。如果已接入遮罩视频，会以遮罩视频为准。": "On: automatically detects and subtracts the subject, useful for videos with a clear subject or single-person replacement. Off: no subject subtraction. If a mask video is connected, it takes priority.",
  "开启后，AI 会自动优化提示词，生成效果更好，费用会有所增加。": "When enabled, AI automatically optimizes the prompt for better results, with higher cost.",
