  "默认不选。长视频叠加适合长视频相关的特殊处理；模拟运镜用于模拟镜头运动效果。两者互斥，只能选一个；再次点击已选项可取消。": "Default is none. Long-video overlay is for special long-video handling; simulated camera motion creates camera movement effects. They are mutually exclusive, so choose only one. Click the selected option again to clear it.",
  "默认推荐，支持文生、图生、首尾帧、全能参考": "Default recommendation, supports text-to-video, image-to-video, first/last frames, and all-purpose reference",
  "默认已填常规排除项，会尽量避开低画质、模糊、变形、水印和多余文字。你也可以改成自己的要求；留空或 none 表示不额外限制。": "Default exclusions are already filled to avoid low quality, blur, deformation, watermarks, and extra text. You can change them to your own requirements; leave empty or use none for no extra restriction.",
