  效率: "Efficient",
  "写清楚视频内容和动作；上传图片时，说清楚图片里的主体怎么动。": "Clearly describe the video content and action. When uploading images, describe how the subject in the image should move.",
  "新全能视频替换BERNINI V1": "New all-purpose video replacement BERNINI V1",
  "新一代架构，兼顾细节与平衡": "Next-generation architecture balancing detail and stability",
