  性能均衡的多模式图像生成: "Balanced multi-mode image generation",
  "选择风格参考算法版本。不同版本会用不同方式理解风格图，影响色彩、质感和氛围的迁移效果。": "Choose the style-reference algorithm version. Different versions interpret style images differently and affect how color, texture, and atmosphere are transferred.",
  "一个 API 搞定一切——节省 30-70%": "One API for everything, saving 30-70%",
  音频分离: "Audio separation",
  音色克隆V1: "Voice Clone V1",
  音色转换: "Voice conversion",
  "影视替换专用，支持源视频、参考图、首帧图与遮罩视频": "For film-style replacement, supports source video, reference image, first-frame image, and mask video",
  "用 @图片1、@视频1 指代参考素材，描述主体、动作、声音和镜头关系。": "Use @Image1 and @Video1 to reference assets, then describe the subject, motion, sound, and camera relationship.",
  "用 @图片1、@视频1 指代参考素材。例如：参考 @图片1 的角色外观和 @视频1 的镜头风格，生成夜晚街道行走视频。": "Use @Image1 and @Video1 to reference assets. Example: use the character appearance from @Image1 and the camera style from @Video1 to generate a walking video on a night street.",
  "用 @图片1、@图片2、@视频1 指代参考素材。例如：@图片1 中的人物来到 @图片2 的场景中，学习 @图片3 的动作，保持角色一致。": "Use @Image1, @Image2, and @Video1 to reference assets. Example: the person from @Image1 enters the scene in @Image2, follows the motion from @Image3, and keeps character consistency.",
  "用于告诉工作流第一张参考图的角色：原图用于常规编辑，姿势图用于姿态约束，深度图用于空间结构约束。": "Tells the workflow what role the first reference image has: original image for normal editing, pose map for pose constraints, depth map for spatial structure constraints.",
  "用于告诉工作流需要检测/识别的主体人数。识别人数不准时再调整。": "Tells the workflow how many subjects to detect/recognize. Adjust only when the detected count is inaccurate.",
  "用于微调遮罩边缘。正数：向外扩，覆盖更多边缘细节；负数：向内收，减少误伤背景。可拖动或输入，支持负数。": "Fine-tunes mask edges. Positive values expand outward to cover more edge detail; negative values contract inward to reduce background spill. Drag or type values; negative values are supported.",
  "用于指定检测识别目标。默认是 person，如无特殊要求请别进行修改。": "Specifies the detection target. Default is person; do not change unless needed.",
  "有风格参考图时生效。控制参考图的色彩、材质、光影和整体氛围影响；值越高越贴近参考风格。": "Applies when a style reference image is present. Controls how much the reference affects color, material, lighting, and overall mood; higher values stay closer to the reference style.",
  "有角色参考图时生效。控制参考角色的脸、发型、服装等细节保留程度；100 尽量保留完整角色，0 更偏向只保留脸部特征。": "Applies when a character reference image is present. Controls how much face, hairstyle, clothing, and other details are preserved; 100 preserves the full character as much as possible, while 0 keeps mainly facial features.",
  "有主输入图时生效。控制主图对内容、构图和颜色的影响；值越高越参考原图，值越低文字提示越主导。": "Applies when a main input image is present. Controls how much the main image affects content, composition, and color; higher values follow the image more, lower values let the text prompt lead.",
