  "官方 Gemini Omni Flash Preview，720p / 24fps": "Official Gemini Omni Flash Preview, 720p / 24fps",
  "doubao-seed-audio-1.0，可用文本和参考音频生成/克隆语音": "Doubao Seed Audio 1.0; generate or clone speech from text and reference audio",
  "兼容 V6 系参数和老项目风格，适合复现旧版效果。": "Compatible with V6-series parameters and older project styles, useful for recreating legacy results.",
  "旧版 Niji，用于兼容已有二次元风格。": "Older Niji version for compatibility with existing anime-style looks.",
  "旧版审美，风格化强，用于兼容 V5.2 效果。": "Older aesthetic with stronger stylization, used for V5.2 compatibility.",
  "可选，作为 cref 传给 Midjourney。": "Optional. Sent to Midjourney as cref.",
  "可选，作为 dref 传给 Midjourney。": "Optional. Sent to Midjourney as dref.",
  "可选，作为 image_urls 传给 Midjourney。": "Optional. Sent to Midjourney as image_urls.",
  "可选，作为 sref 传给 Midjourney。": "Optional. Sent to Midjourney as sref.",
  平铺: "Tile",
  "轻量版图像生成，固定 1K 输出": "Lite image generation with fixed 1K output",
  深度参考图: "Depth reference image",
  深度权重: "Depth weight",
  "生成可无缝衔接的重复图案。": "Generate a seamless repeating pattern.",
  "输入效果提示词和合成文本，支持上传并 @ 参考音频，自由参考音色、情感、风格、节奏等。例如：请参考 @音频1 的音色，参考 @音频2 的声音风格，说：“今天的天气很好，我们一起出去走走吧。” 单次最长可生成约 2 分钟音频，若文本较长，语速可能会相应加快。": "Enter effect instructions and synthesis text. You can upload and @ reference audio to guide voice tone, emotion, style, rhythm, and more. Example: Please reference the voice tone of @Audio1 and the speaking style of @Audio2, and say: \"The weather is lovely today. Let's go out for a walk.\" A single run can generate about 2 minutes of audio; longer text may be spoken faster.",
  速度: "Speed",
  速度模式: "Speed mode",
  "通用度高，提示词跟随和风格稳定性较平衡。": "Highly versatile, with balanced prompt following and style stability.",
  "透传其他 Midjourney --xxx 参数，会追加到提示词。": "Pass through other Midjourney --xxx parameters; they are appended to the prompt.",
  图片参考: "Image reference",
  "文生图 / 单图编辑，无参考图时自动文生": "Text-to-image / single-image editing; automatically text-to-image when no reference image is connected",
  "新版 Niji，偏动漫、插画、人设和二次元风格。": "Newer Niji version, geared toward anime, illustration, character design, and 2D styles.",
  "新版 V8 系，适合稳定的写实、电影感和产品图。": "Newer V8 series, suitable for stable realism, cinematic looks, and product images.",
  "选择 APIMart Midjourney 的版本。V8 更新，V7 更稳，V6/V5 用于兼容旧风格，Niji 偏二次元和插画。": "Choose the APIMart Midjourney version. V8 is newer, V7 is steadier, V6/V5 are for legacy style compatibility, and Niji leans toward anime and illustration.",
  "选择 APIMart MJ 任务的队列速度。Relax 省额度但慢，Fast 平衡，Turbo 最快但更耗额度。": "Choose the APIMart MJ queue speed. Relax saves quota but is slower, Fast is balanced, and Turbo is fastest but uses more quota.",
  音频参考: "Audio reference",
  "有风格参考图时生效。": "Applies when a style reference image is connected.",
  "有角色参考图时生效。": "Applies when a character reference image is connected.",
  "有深度参考图时生效。": "Applies when a depth reference image is connected.",
  "有主输入图时生效。": "Applies when a main input image is connected.",
  语调: "Tone",
  "支持文生视频、首帧图生视频和首尾帧视频的 RunningHub 工作流": "RunningHub workflow supporting text-to-video, first-frame image-to-video, and first-last-frame video",
  种子: "Seed",
  "最快模式，适合急需预览或快速迭代。": "Fastest mode, suitable for urgent previews or rapid iteration.",
  "最新版，优先用于通用生图和高质量出图。": "Latest version, recommended first for general image generation and high-quality output.",
  "doubao-seed-audio-1.0": "Doubao Seed Audio 1.0",
  "doubao-seed-audio-1.0（Audio 1.0）用法：\n  1. 输入合成文本，也可以描述想要的音色、情绪、风格、节奏或环境声\n  2. 可连接 1-3 段参考音频用于克隆/参考声音特征\n  3. 提示词可手写 @音频1、@音频2 精确指定参考；未手写时会自动引用已连接音频\n  4. 高级设置可调节语调、语速、音量和输出格式\n\n需要火山语音 Audio 1.0 API 白名单/权限；体验中心可用不代表当前 X-Api-Key 已有接口权限。\n提示词最长 3000 字；单次最长约 120 秒音频。": "Doubao Seed Audio 1.0 usage:\n  1. Enter synthesis text; you can also describe the desired voice tone, emotion, style, rhythm, or ambience\n  2. Connect 1-3 reference audio clips for cloning or voice-character reference\n  3. You can explicitly write @Audio1, @Audio2 in the prompt to target references; if omitted, connected audio is referenced automatically\n  4. Advanced settings can adjust tone, speech speed, volume, and output format\n\nRequires Volcengine Speech Audio 1.0 API whitelist / permission; being available in the demo center does not mean the current X-Api-Key has API access.\nPrompts can be up to 3000 characters; one run can generate about 120 seconds of audio.",
  "HappyHorse 1.1 参考图生视频\n[[red:接 1-9 张参考图]]：参考人物、主体、风格或场景，生成全新画面。\n[[red:没入参时]]：仍然是文生视频，只按提示词生成。\n适合统一角色或风格，多张图可以给更多外观参考。\n提示词例子：参考图中的角色在未来城市中行走，镜头从侧面缓慢环绕，灯光有电影感。": "HappyHorse 1.1 reference-image video generation\n[[red:Connect 1-9 reference images]]: reference people, subjects, styles, or scenes to generate a new shot.\n[[red:With no inputs]]: still text-to-video, generated only from the prompt.\nUseful for keeping character or style consistent; multiple images provide more appearance references.\nPrompt example: the character from the reference image walks through a futuristic city, the camera slowly orbits from the side, with cinematic lighting.",
  "HappyHorse 1.1 图生视频\n[[red:接 1 张图]]：把这张图当视频起点，让画面动起来。\n[[red:没入参时]]：仍然是文生视频，只按提示词生成。\n适合人物转身、表情变化、镜头推进这类从一张图开始的变化。\n提示词例子：画面中的女孩慢慢转身看向镜头，发丝被风吹动，背景轻微虚化。": "HappyHorse 1.1 image-to-video\n[[red:Connect one image]]: use this image as the video starting point and make the scene move.\n[[red:With no inputs]]: still text-to-video, generated only from the prompt.\nUseful for changes starting from one image, such as character turns, expression changes, and camera push-ins.\nPrompt example: the girl in the image slowly turns to look at the camera, hair moving in the wind, background slightly blurred.",
  "HappyHorse 1.1 文生视频\n[[red:没入参时]]：只写提示词，就是文生视频。\n适合直接生成新画面、动作和镜头。\n提示词例子：一只白色小狗在草地上奔跑，镜头低角度跟拍，阳光明亮，慢动作。": "HappyHorse 1.1 text-to-video\n[[red:With no inputs]]: write only the prompt for text-to-video.\nUseful for directly generating new visuals, motion, and camera shots.\nPrompt example: a white puppy runs across grass, low-angle tracking shot, bright sunlight, slow motion.",
  "Midjourney --no，用于排除不想要的元素。": "Midjourney --no, used to exclude unwanted elements.",
  "Midjourney --q 质量参数，控制渲染投入，不等于图片尺寸放大。": "Midjourney --q quality parameter, controls rendering effort and does not upscale image size.",
