  "Wan2.2 视频模型": "Wan2.2 video model",
  "Wan2.2 视频模型用法\n不接图时为文生视频；接入首帧时为图生视频；同时接入首帧和尾帧时为首尾帧视频。\n分辨率用于选择清晰度，比例用于选择横屏、竖屏或方形画面。": "Wan2.2 video model usage\nWith no image connected, it runs text-to-video. Connect a first frame for image-to-video. Connect both first and last frames for first-last-frame video.\nResolution controls clarity; aspect ratio chooses landscape, portrait, or square framing.",
